                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    My views on social media is similar to pope francis views, as someone who has done research into groups on social media and also is part of online communities I can see both sides of the coin where social media both helps and harms. I have seen communities like the flat earth community but also I have seen some people who need the escape from real life through social media due to their current situation being ones which are hard to escape.
